For this process, Article 10 of the Organic Law on Control over Electoral and Campaign Spending is applicable, using the following values for the corresponding calculation:
Election of the President and Vice-President of the Republic: zero point fifteen dollars (US$0.15);
Election of members of the Andean Parliament: zero point zero five dollars (US$0.05);
Election of national and provincial Assembly persons and prefects: zero point fifteen dollars (US$0.15);
Election of Assembly persons representing nationals living abroad: zero point thirty dollars (US$0.30);
Election of mayors: zero point fifteen dollars (US$0.15);
Election of council persons: the maximum amount shall be sixty percent (60%) of the amount set for the respective mayor;
Election of members of parish boards: zero point thirty dollars (US$0.30.
